    "prompt":  "A high-converting, state-of-the-art landing page for Domingosstudio ÔÇö a high-end digital design, brand systems, and web engineering studio.\n\nKey sections:\n1. Hero Section:\n   - Eyebrow badge: \u0027Ô£¿ Available for new design \u0026 engineering partnerships\u0027\n   - Bold headline: \u0027We craft digital products that redefine industry benchmarks\u0027\n   - Subheading: \u0027Domingosstudio partners with hyper-growth tech founders and category leaders to build unforgettable brands, high-performance interfaces, and design systems.\u0027\n   - Dual CTAs: Primary \u0027Book an Intro Call\u0027 (with royal blue glow #0066ff) and Secondary \u0027Explore Our Work\u0027 with arrow icon.\n   - Social proof ticker/client logos: Leading tech brands (Linear, Vercel, Supabase, Raycast, Stripe style typography).\n\n2. Featured Work / Showcase Grid:\n   - Dynamic portfolio preview cards displaying interactive project mockups, tags (Design System, Next.js, Mobile App, 3D WebGL), client names, impact metrics (e.g., \u0027+340% User Conversion\u0027, \u0027$45M Series A Raised\u0027, \u0027AOTD Winner\u0027).\n\n3. Core Disciplines / Capabilities:\n   - Interactive bento-grid of services:\n     - 01 Product Design \u0026 UI/UX (Design systems, micro-interactions, responsive prototypes)\n     - 02 Creative Development \u0026 WebGL (High-performance web architecture, Three.js, smooth animations)\n     - 03 Brand Identity \u0026 Strategy (Art direction, visual identity, type foundry collaboration)\n     - 04 AI Experience Design (Generative UI, agentic workflows, conversational interfaces)\n\n4. Studio Stats / Proof of Excellence:\n   - Highlight metrics in cyber-sky and royal blue accents: \u002798%\u0027 Client Retention, \u002742+\u0027 Global Design Awards, \u0027$1.2B+\u0027 Client Valuation Created, \u002714\u0027 Average Weeks to MVP.\n\n5. Testimonials \u0026 Client Endorsements:\n   - Quotes from founders, CTOs, and heads of product praising speed, craft, and business impact.\n\n6. Interactive Pricing / Engagement Models:\n   - Clear comparison cards: \u0027Sprint / Project Basis\u0027 vs \u0027Design \u0026 Dev Subscription (Studio Retainer)\u0027 with clear deliverables, timeline, and CTA.\n\n7. Final High-Impact CTA:\n   - \u0027Have a vision? LetÔÇÖs bring it to life.\u0027 with direct calendar booking trigger and contact info.\n\nVisuals \u0026 Styling:\nAdhere strictly to the Domingosstudio Design System: Dark obsidian background (#030712 / #080e1e), electric royal blue (#0066ff) primary buttons and glow gradients, cyber sky blue (#00d2ff) accents and highlights, Plus Jakarta Sans typography, sleek card borders with subtle glassmorphism and fine 1px borders.",
