                                              "styleGuidelines":  "## Brand \u0026 Style\nThis design system embodies a cutting-edge, high-contrast digital aesthetic. Targeted at modern tech-forward platforms, creative developers, and high-performance SaaS applications, the visual tone is electric, futuristic, and unapologetically bold. It evokes a sense of speed, precision, and immersive digital craftsmanship. \n\nWe utilize a dark-mode-first paradigm blending sleek obsidian surfaces with vibrant, luminous accents that guide the user\u0027s eye naturally through complex interfaces.\n\n## Layout \u0026 Spacing\nThe layout system relies on a consistent 16px (`1rem`) foundational rhythm, scaling fluidly across adaptive viewports. We utilize a fluid grid framework with dynamic column scaling and consistent outer margins to maximize screen real estate while preserving breathing room around dense data displays. \n\nComponent padding and spatial gaps strictly adhere to the defined `space-*` scale to maintain proportional harmony throughout the interface.\n\n## Elevation \u0026 Depth\nDepth is articulated through a sophisticated interplay of tonal surface layering and ambient glow effects rather than harsh drop shadows. \n\nBy stacking darker obsidian backgrounds against slightly lighter secondary panels (`#080e1e`), UI containers achieve natural elevation. This is frequently augmented by subtle, low-opacity electric blue (`#0066ff`) or cyber blue (`#00d2ff`) outer glows and fine ghost borders, reinforcing the futuristic, high-tech identity.\n\n## Components\n- **Buttons:** Primary actions utilize solid Electric Royal Blue (`#0066ff`) fills with white text and subtle hover scaling. Secondary actions adopt transparent backgrounds with fine Cyber Sky Blue borders (`#00d2ff`) that illuminate on hover.\n- **Chips:** Compact pill-shaped elements featuring dark secondary backgrounds, muted slate text, and optional glowing status indicators.\n- **Input Fields:** Deep obsidian input wells featuring low-contrast outlines that shift to a vibrant electric blue focus state with matching ambient glow.\n- **Cards:** Elevated container surfaces (`#080e1e`) with soft rounded corners, subtle border separation, and clear internal padding adhering to the base spacing rhythm.\n- **Checkboxes \u0026 Radios:** Custom geometric controls featuring crisp borders, checking via filled primary accents, and smooth transition states.\n- **Lists:** Clean typographic stacking with generous vertical rhythm, optimized for scannability and clear separation using muted dividers.",
